WEBVTT

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.290
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.580
Winter of my senior year in junior high...

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.950
...I stopped growing.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.120
I found myself looking down
at my legs more often.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.910
Keep your head up.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:53.370
Chiyuki.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:57.080
What does a model need the most?

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:57.790
Height.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.330
No.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.370
I'm sorry!

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.500
I'm late...

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.040
Chiyuki, what's most important...

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.000
"Episode 7: Aura"

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.450
"Episode 7: Aura"
...is your aura.

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:19.950
So Chiyuki, keep your head up!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.830
Put your soul into your eyes.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:31.950
Nice to meet you.
I'm Chiyuki Fujito of Mille Neige.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.000
Oh...

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.330
Excuse me.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:40.160
This short model will bring the quality down.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.290
Please send her home.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.200
What?

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.370
Who's responsible for calling in this model?

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.790
Excuse me, what is
the arrangement for this shoot?

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.330
I brought my own heels,
ranging from 12 to 15 cm.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:57.040
As long as our feet aren't visible,
it should be okay.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.580
I did ask for any model who's available.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.410
Will you please let us off the hook this time?

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.370
Oh...

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.410
This is the arrangement for today.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.450
O-Oh...

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:13.080
"Everyone except Kokoro Hasegawa
covers their face."

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:17.540
It really could've been anybody...

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:24.200
Then, I'll just have to put in
my all however I can.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:29.120
My face is hidden, but whatever's visible
can still be stunning.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.750
And...

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:34.620
Excuse me, do you know how you'll pose today?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.870
Solidify the plan.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:40.370
I'll be the best supporting model.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.500
Excuse me.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.120
Oh! W-Were... you talking to me?

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.700
O-Oh...

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.120
If you're unmotivated, just leave.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.500
What...?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.620
We're merely props for this girl
with our faces covered?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.120
You gotta be kidding me.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.120
That's right...

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.700
She's not my only rival here...

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:09.500
Then... Do you know the two places
where aura comes from?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:17.450
The first is through your figure,
posture, gestures, and height.
